msgstr "避免从另一生命周期或状态维度虚构 invocationOutcome 目标。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference the actual gmeow:ModelInvocationOutcome supplied by the source and retain attributed alternatives."
msgstr "引用来源实际提供的 gmeow:ModelInvocationOutcome，并保留有归属的其他解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/invocationOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:record gmeow:invocationOutcome ex:target ."
msgstr "ex:record gmeow:invocationOutcome ex:target ."

