msgstr "意图转换对象"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The intention whose recorded lifecycle transition this event describes."
msgstr "此事件描述的已记录生命周期转换所属意图。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/intentionTransitionOf|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
